 "audio_url": null,
 "note_en": "A 部首 (bùshǒu) or radical is the part of a character that often hints at its meaning: 带“氵”的字一般跟水有关系 \"characters with 氵 are usually related to water.\" The pattern 跟……有关系 means \"to be related to...\"; notice that the thing it relates to comes in the middle, between 跟 and 有关系.",
